[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18961.27, "timestamp": "05:16:01", "text": "它们就像这里的东西一样。 就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18963.43, "timestamp": "05:16:03", "text": "你需要某些东西才能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18965.75, "timestamp": "05:16:05", "text": "制作其他东西，而用其他东西才能制作其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18970.31, "timestamp": "05:16:10", "text": "东西一样。 你收到了吗？ 是的。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18971.55, "timestamp": "05:16:11", "text": "这真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18974.39, "timestamp": "05:16:14", "text": "奇怪了。 它不是很直。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18976.628, "timestamp": "05:16:16", "text": "那棵树，我刚砍了一棵树，它好像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18986.39, "timestamp": "05:16:26", "text": "我要控制这艘船，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18988.27, "timestamp": "05:16:28", "text": "看看会发生什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18991.99, "timestamp": "05:16:31", "text": "好的。 别离开我。 你也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18995.59, "timestamp": "05:16:35", "text": "收到任务完成奖励之类的东西了吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18998.07, "timestamp": "05:16:38", "text": "？ 它能给你带来什么吗？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19000.708, "timestamp": "05:16:40", "text": "。 我奖励西瓜头盔弹射"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19003.43, "timestamp": "05:16:43", "text": "探索点3。 嗯，我想我晚点再做，因为据"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19010.07, "timestamp": "05:16:50", "text": "我所知，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19013.11, "timestamp": "05:16:53", "text": "如果我在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19018.15, "timestamp": "05:16:58", "text": "我的服务器上做了什么，它仍然会计入你的服务器上。 是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19019.98, "timestamp": "05:16:59", "text": "。"}]